	'messages:managewiki-header-settings' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s settings (such as logo, styling, and more) from this panel. Be careful! Make sure to carefully read setting descriptions and do not toggle random settings indiscriminately unless you understand what it does. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds. 

